  "post_content": "<p>Anoche se inaugur&oacute; en Onda la nueva Sala Kubrick, que ofrecer&aacute; conciertos de indie pop-rock todos los viernes y s&aacute;bados, en el mismo local de Stravaganzza, que continuar&aacute; con sus sesiones los s&aacute;bados a partir de la 1 de la madrugada.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/03/IMG_1482.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El concierto inaugural se inici&oacute; con la actuaci&oacute;n de El retrato (en las fotos) y actuaron tambi&eacute;n Parco, Loretta&#39;s y Abokajarro.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugsalakubrick/img_1475.jpg\" alt=\"img_1475\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugsalakubrick/img_1476.jpg\" alt=\"img_1476\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugsalakubrick/img_1478.jpg\" alt=\"img_1478\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugsalakubrick/img_1479.jpg\" alt=\"img_1479\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugsalakubrick/img_1480.jpg\" alt=\"img_1480\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugsalakubrick/img_1481.jpg\" alt=\"img_1481\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugsalakubrick/img_1482.jpg\" alt=\"img_1482\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugsalakubrick/img_1483.jpg\" alt=\"img_1483\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugsalakubrick/img_1484.jpg\" alt=